sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Student
  participant App as iOS / Web
  participant API as Azure Functions
  participant DB as Cosmos DB
  participant AI as Azure OpenAI
  U->>App: Writes entry sheet, taps "Review"
  App->>API: POST /es/{id}/review (with token)
  API->>API: Validate token, check rate limit
  API->>DB: Load draft and profile
  API->>AI: Prompt (keigo, structure, STAR)
  AI-->>API: Issues and suggestions (JSON)
  API->>DB: Save review
  API-->>App: Result
  App-->>U: Highlights issues (FR/EN explanations)
